STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT ========================================================== 
COMMENT                Wen Quan Yi Bitmap Song 
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT Summary:
COMMENT 
COMMENT     	Developer: The WenQuanYi Project Contributors
COMMENT     	Webpage  : http://wqy.sourceforge.net/en/
COMMENT     	Font Name: WenQuanYi Bitmap Song
COMMENT     	Version  : 0.7 (Dou)
COMMENT     	Release  : 4
COMMENT     	Copyright: (C)2004-2006, The WenQuanYi Project 
COMMENT     		   Board of Trustees and Qianqian Fang
COMMENT     	License  : GPL v2.0 (with font embedding exception)
COMMENT 
COMMENT           May the Font be with you, forever!
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT The Wen Quan Yi bitmap font includes complete CJK Unified 
COMMENT Ideograph (U4E00 - U9FA5) glyphs at four different sizes 
COMMENT (9pt-12X12 pixel, 10pt-13X13 pixel, 11pt-15X15 pixel, 
COMMENT 12pt-16x16 pixel) and two weights (medium and bold). 
COMMENT Use of this bitmap font for on-screen display of Chinese 
COMMENT (traditional and simplified) in web pages and elsewhere 
COMMENT eliminates the annoying "blurring" problems caused by 
COMMENT the high stroke density of many Chinese characters and 
COMMENT insufficient "hinting" of anti-aliased Chinese fonts. 
COMMENT For the 12pt font, Hangul glyphs (U+AC00~U+D7A3) from 
COMMENT GNU Unifont (Roman Czyborra/David Starner et al.) were 
COMMENT used for bold face while those from Hanterm 3.x were used 
COMMENT for the medium face.
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT Project starting date       2004/10/26
COMMENT CJK Basic completed on      2005/4/10
COMMENT Sourceforge registration    2005/1/7
COMMENT CJK Basic character total   20902
COMMENT Total glyphs from firefly   15832 X 4 sizes
COMMENT New glyphs                  15210
COMMENT Improved glyph number       > 50,000
COMMENT Partitions (101 char each)  207
COMMENT Online partitions           53
COMMENT Offline partitions          154
COMMENT Webspace providers          wenq.org,Dartmouth CSSA,sourceforge,lwfs.net
COMMENT 
COMMENT Core members                FangQ,caiqian,fundawang,wanghong,tchaikov
COMMENT                             ailantian, niqiu, fiag
COMMENT Team B members              ailantian,activeion,amadeoh,BabyPBC,BenBear,  
COMMENT                             brep,chaoslawful,DannyZeng,farm,fiag,keykeen,
COMMENT                             liyi,lucifer,nilarcs,niqiu,pangwa,pathfinder,
COMMENT                             pinker,PONY,pupilzeng,shhky,stid,wuler.lv,
COMMENT                             xnuxmwx,namespace,leftstand,MarkLam,buick,
COMMENT                             liqian,qinling,Seeker,xiaoma,ZaiJianQingRen,
COMMENT 			    SiCengXiangShi,the_owl,whppc,eka,failsafe,
COMMENT                             musiccow,Blueelf,lenovox,udi,leal
COMMENT 
COMMENT This font includes 11172 Korean glyphs from GNU unifonts
COMMENT compiled by Roman Czyborra/David Starner.
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
COMMENT This file: WenQuanYi Bitmap Song 12pt bold
COMMENT Created by Qianqian Fang (fangq #nmr _mgh _harvard _edu)
COMMENT ----------------------------------------------------------
